{"version":1,"content":"<p>剛於前日（24號）生日的歌手菊梓喬（Hana），日前在廣州舉行粉絲聚會提早慶祝，身穿綠色毛毛外套的她，與手上的蛋糕襯到絕。</p><p>另外，她又現身現播間與粉絲聊天，期間有粉絲表示正準備公開試，她即以自身經歷送上鼓勵，透露曾花了一年時間苦讀：「由中三一</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:23:55.050016+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T11:01:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:13.104195+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:13.104195+00:00","content_hash":"0954597f5b6a363fe3e7474dca0f6d4453287de4784fb2e50f77c0c47bc90f0f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}